    <string name="help_migration_title">Move from another calendar app</string>
    <string name="help_migration_sub">Use the calendars already on your phone</string>
    <string name="help_migration_body">Sunlith reads Android\'s shared calendar storage, so existing calendars can appear without an import.\n\n1. Open Calendars in Sunlith and select the calendars you use.\n2. Check a few timed, all-day and repeating events.\n3. If an account is missing, add it in Android settings and turn on calendar sync.\n\nUse .ics import when you need to copy events into another calendar. Back them up first and avoid importing into a calendar that already contains them.\n\nChoose one app to send reminders if several apps notify for the same events.</string>
